sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RecipientDevice as Recipient Device
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    RecipientDevice->>API: POST /api/v1/envelopes/:id/delivered
    API->>DB: UPDATE message_recipient_devices SET delivery_status='delivered'
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO message_acknowledgements
    API-->>RecipientDevice: 200 OK

    RecipientDevice->>API: POST /api/v1/envelopes/:id/read
    API->>DB: UPSERT message_read_states
    API-->>RecipientDevice: 200 OK
